          "In PRINCE2 7, tolerances can be set against seven performance targets: time, cost, quality, scope, benefits, risk and sustainability. Sustainability was added in the seventh edition; older articles list only six. A [business case template](/templates/business-case-template/) is a practical starting point for the document that keeps the whole method honest.",
